# Stage 0 — line-ending discipline.
# Stage 1 compares netlists BYTE-IDENTICAL against golden references.
# A single CRLF/LF flip would fail every future netlist test, so all
# SPICE/netlist/golden text artifacts are forced to LF for all time.
* text=auto
*.cir text eol=lf
*.sp text eol=lf
*.net text eol=lf
*.cdl text eol=lf
*.golden text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.gds binary
*.oas binary
